   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Phew...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I can't stop thinking about what[n]Akechi-kun said...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It'll be all right.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_004_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm worried...",
   "uk": "Мені тривожно...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_004_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Don't think about that now.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "*giggle*",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "It feels like nothing bad could ever[n]happen when you say that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "It's so frustrating being unable[n]to do anything...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Yes. I was looking forward to this party,[n]so we should enjoy it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "And now, it's time for your[n]favorite Shujin tradition:[n]the Student Sharing Special!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "Round of applause, everyone!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Sharing...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I never knew we had such an event.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "All right, who has something to say?[n]Anyone, anyone!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "No? I'll just have to pick someone then!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Ooh, he's going to choose?[n]I wonder who it will be...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "How about that fluffy-haired girl[n]over there!? I choose you!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Is he... looking this way?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "Well then, come on up!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "He's talking to me... isn't he?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're up.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Just ignore him.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's 'cause you're cute.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "So it really is me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I can't do that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Oh!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "Come, come. Everyone's waiting!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Well, I'm going.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "And your name is?[n]Wait, you're Okumura-san!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Um, yes...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "U-Uhhh...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "I'm sure you're, um... still grieving...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "My, um... deepest apologies...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_031_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Oh, please don't worry!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_032_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "So uh, do you have anything you'd like[n]to share with us?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Something to share...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I have too many things...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_035_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "Errr... Here, let me give you[n]a question then...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_035_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "Do you think the Phantom Thieves[n]are really Shujin students?",
