   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_036_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_038_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "I mean, they are... uh...[n]your father's killers...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_038_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "We're all dying to know what[n]Akechi-kun was going to say about[n]their true identities.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_038_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "So, are they from Shujin? What do you[n]think, Okumura-san?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_039_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Erm...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_039_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Haru is in trouble...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_039_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I need to change[n]the subject...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_037_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Well...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_037_7_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Do you have a boyfriend!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_037_7_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Please date me!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_037_7_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I've always loved you!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_040_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_041_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Post-Festival MC",
   "en": "To tell you the truth, I'm interested[n]in that myself!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_042_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
